    \item All results published on GitHub Pages
    \item Hundreds of framework implementations tracked
    \item Real Chrome browser — not synthetic JS engine tests
    \item CPU throttling simulates lower-end hardware
  \end{itemize}
  \vspace{5pt}

  \colorbox{panelbg2}{\parbox{0.91\linewidth}{%
    \fontsize{18}{24}\selectfont
